            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Chronic pan management is still an evolving field, one with high fees and debatable results. It's open to a variety of practitioners, but pain specialists concerned about accountability, reimbursement, and their own survival are developing needed standards for treatment and outcome measurement.</AbstractText>
